    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A troubadour may combine combat spheres and talents to create powerful martial techniques. Troubadours are considered Proficient combatants. A troubadour uses their casting ability modifier as their practitioner modifier. If they do not have a casting ability modifier, it defaults to Charisma.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/troubadour#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
